Shannon -

Nice job on the draft website!

*WEB EDITS*
Attached is a document with our collective edits following review of the
draft website.

Also attaching a quote mark graphic and T-shirt design graphic - both PNGs
with transparent background. These are referenced in the edits document.

NOTE: It's possible that my other team members may choose to either alter
one of the Funding Priorities or Add one in the next day or two. I'll ask
them to let you know ASAP if that's what they decide. Otherwise, this
should be pretty much it.

Please let me know if you have questions or concerns.

*EMAIL ACCESS*
As noted in an earlier email, I am able to log into Zoho to access our
contacts@friendsofWDAC.org email address. Please send similar invitations
to Andrew, Gail and Joyce, so they, too, can access the email. If we go
live by April 29, they'll need to be able to check the email address, since
it is referenced all over the site.

Again, I'll be out of state and out of pocket April 29 - May 5.

Thank you!

- Stephenie, 907-382-3327

